RoleDescText.LocalizedString:
For Hathor, being a "courier" is the perfect profession.
1. Confirm time and address;
2. Deliver to recipient;
3. Get signature and complete. It rarely requires much conversation.
Though she occasionally encounters problem clients, the solution is simple: just strike fear in their hearts.
During her free time, Hathor prefers to stay home, sitting by the window where sunlight streams in, emotionlessly eating an entire box of chocolate-decorated cookies without drinking any water.
